- **Salt/mixture handling policy** and whether computed (predicted) vs. experimental property values are expected."}], "reasoning_content": "Network is disabled — pip install fails. No chemistry libraries available. No dataset in the repository. So the design must be written assuming data and tooling would need to be provided, or the design should specify how to handle this (e.g., self-contained SMILES embedded, pure-Python property calculators). But this is design-only; the task is to propose the experiment design. I should present the plan with stated assumptions and uncertainties.

