5. Analysis: descriptive stats (mean/median/IQR), distributions/histograms, correlations (Pearson/Spearman among MW, logP, TPSA), drug-likeness screen (Lipinski RO5, Veber), stratification if metadata present (e.g., by source/class), outlier detection.
6. Deliverables: property table CSV, summary stats, plots, validation report.

